{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/25/9395855/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/25/9395855/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しき、おだんごツイン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、撮影とレッスンのあいまに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、かなりん、まりか、まいまい姉さまと、パンケーキを食べに行ってきました＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/25/9395855/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと待ち合わせして、まりかとパンケーキ屋さんに向かったんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたりとも道がわからず、方向音痴のわたしが、まりかをあっちこっちに連れ回しちゃいました(;_;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんねまりか、(つω•｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ふたりでお話しながらお散歩できて、楽しかったです（ ＾o＾ )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽじてぃゔっ＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、また遠くへ行っての撮影だったんですが、かなり寒い撮影で、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"究極な寒がりのわたしを、まりかが抱きついてあっためてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか本当に優しい。だいすき。照り"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影は、大変だけれど、それ以上に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどんメンバーのこと好きになって、結束力が高まってく(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいことだっ（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残りの制作期間も気を引き締めて、がんばりますっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、夜ご飯には、みさ先輩と、ゆったんと、まいまい姉さまと、とまとと、パスタを食べに行ったんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少食で全部食べきれなかったら、ゆったんが食べてくれました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこもナイスチームワーク！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがっす！正義っす！ヽ(｀･ω･´)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日は、中山競馬場にてイベントですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさま、ぜひ来てくださいね ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとは違った１１人編成なので、かなりレアなライヴが見れると思います！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしが...   ＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぎゃぁぁあああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/25/9395855/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃん"}],"source":"archive"}